WEBVTT

WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:01.720 --> 00:00:03.200
¿En realidad?

00:00:04.440 --> 00:00:07.240
Henry, you still haven't answered.

00:00:08.840 --> 00:00:09.960
Come on, brother.

00:00:09.960 --> 00:00:11.600
Give it a rest.

00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:12.960
I don't remember

00:00:12.960 --> 00:00:14.920
where I was or

00:00:15.080 --> 00:00:17.040
who I was with yesterday and

00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:19.160
you're asking me about last week.

00:00:19.160 --> 00:00:22.160
So where do I sit?

00:00:22.760 --> 00:00:24.600
What spot did you save

00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:26.920
for your firstborn, father?

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:28.720
Your place, as always,

00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:30.960
is next to your brother.

00:00:31.040 --> 00:00:33.440
By the way, where is your wife?

00:00:33.520 --> 00:00:35.000
Are you alone tonight?

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:36.480
Oh, no.

00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:40.000
I didn't come alone.

00:00:41.600 --> 00:00:42.400
Are you okay?

00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:43.680
Come with me.

00:00:43.760 --> 00:00:44.320
Come in.

00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:45.800
Come in.

00:00:46.080 --> 00:00:47.680
I brought a friend.
